        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-12T22:00:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sorry about any confusion. The reason we put it up for sale right when we got it is that we knew we'd get a bunch of orders, and it saves us a huge amount of time if we can send a big bunch of orders to FedEx for bulk label printing all at once instead of having to make each label manually one at a time. In the future, we'll communicate better about shipping times, etc, when we put new products up at the same time that Kickstarter rewards ship.</p>",
